format 1

# x86_64-darwin on an Apple Silicon Mac under Rosetta: the owner chose
# emulation, so the job still evaluates and builds x86_64-darwin.

## workflows
id|kind|systems|cache|args
ci|gate|x86_64-darwin|-|emulate=x86_64-darwin

## runners
system|labels
x86_64-darwin|self-hosted, macOS, ARM64
